WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,380
Where have you two been? You've gone far away.

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:04,380
had a fall

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,020
All the fruits picked have fallen into pieces.

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:13,390
Why do you guys smell like barbecue no matter where you go?

5
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:14,790
As long as there is no emergency team

6
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,910
I didn’t steal public goods either. I won’t ask any further questions.

7
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:19,670
But we can’t skip the tasks that need to be done tomorrow.

8
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,030
You don't say it, right?

9
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,150
I'll see for myself tomorrow

10
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:25,870
We met someone baking something on the way

11
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:26,790
Maybe it's smelly

12
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:28,630
Who is barbecuing on the island except Suche?

13
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,380
Don’t judge people first

14
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,380
Wild fruit found today

15
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,420
Test first if you can eat it

16
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:43,690
It’s not normal for something purely natural to be sour.

17
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,490
As long as you can eat it, Su Che's fruits

18
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:46,570
It might be too sweet to be greasy

19
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:47,530
Not as good as our health

20
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:49,370
If you can replenish your vitamins, just eat it and don’t pick on the taste.

21
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,080
It’s also a vitamin supplement

22
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,400
Is the gap too big?
